{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1790,
    "dDurationMs": 6300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here are some facts about great white sharks:\nwhite sharks are live-birthed, usually in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8090,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "litters of between four and seven individuals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10760,
    "dDurationMs": 7110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now they're called pups, but when they're\nborn they're between 1.2 and 1.5 meters!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17870,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's a pretty big baby."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21630,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It takes a great white shark about ten to\ntwelve years to reach maturity at which point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26210,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the females are actually about a meter longer\nthan the males - the largest recorded being"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30950,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over six meters - roughly the size of this\nred boat behind me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34900,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At this length they'd weigh about two to three\nthousand kilograms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39100,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh man!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41050,
    "dDurationMs": 7770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now there are stories of some great whites\nbeing over seven meters but those are unsubstantiated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48820,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "White sharks are warm bodied."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50820,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're not warm-blooded like us - they can't\nmaintain a perfectly stable temperature, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55140,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their internal organs are kept at up to thirteen\ndegrees above the average temperature of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60640,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ambient water around them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62540,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The heat generated by their muscles is actually\ntransferred to the blood in their veins as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66580,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it returns from the shark's extremities, so\nit warms it up and keeps the core temperature"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71940,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a little bit hotter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73170,
    "dDurationMs": 4930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This allows the shark to venture into colder\nwaters and also to have explosive power."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78100,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its muscles work a lot better when warm than\nwhen cold, just like ours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82580,
    "dDurationMs": 4810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tradeoff is the shark requires about ten\ntimes as much energy as if it didn't heat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87390,
    "dDurationMs": 7510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its body and that's why they need to feed\non these blubber-rich seals and whale carcasses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94900,
    "dDurationMs": 3899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "White sharks like to hunt when it's light\nout because they use their eyesight to spot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98799,
    "dDurationMs": 1381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their prey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100180,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when they open their jaws, their eyes\nactually roll back into their head to protect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104250,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them and so they're actually blind when they're\ntaking a bite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107500,
    "dDurationMs": 4310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now they do like conditions that are a little\nlow visibility because they rely on stealth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111810,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to track down their prey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112990,
    "dDurationMs": 4790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If a seal spots them coming, it's basically\ngame over because the seal is so much more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117780,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maneuverable and it can definitely get away\nfrom the shark."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120890,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they only eat sea mammals after they're\nabout 2.5 meters long, which is why most of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126110,
    "dDurationMs": 2909,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the sharks we're seeing around here are quite\nlarge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129019,
    "dDurationMs": 3411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before that, they're diet consists mainly\nof fish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132430,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The gestation period is thought to be about\neighteen months and that leads to a two to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136900,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "three year reproduction cycle and with such\nsmall litters that means it takes a long time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142180,
    "dDurationMs": 2089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for this shark population to recover."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144269,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are a couple misconceptions about great\nwhite sharks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148989,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is that they can't get cancer and that's\nled to a lot of people hunting them down and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153389,
    "dDurationMs": 3371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trying to use their fins as an anti-cancer\nsoup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156760,
    "dDurationMs": 3989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in reality sharks get cancer just like\nanything else and there is photographic evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160749,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of sharks with big tumors so it makes no sense\nto hunt down sharks as a cancer remedy because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166489,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they get cancer just like we do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170709,
    "dDurationMs": 4441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another misconception is sharks are coastal\ncreatures that just cruise the beaches waiting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175150,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to bite people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176559,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In reality the sharks spend much of their\ntime way, way out at sea and very deep, over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181639,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a kilometer deep."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183359,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's kind of shocking but we've only found\nthis out in the last couple of years so there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187659,
    "dDurationMs": 3181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is so much about sharks that remains undiscovered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190840,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We don't know where they go or what they do\nfor most of the time that they're alive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195230,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why research projects like this are\nso important to find out more about the shark"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199130,
    "dDurationMs": 5279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and figure out how we can help it rehabilitate\nand become the predator of the sea that it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204409,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "once was."
    } ]
  } ]
}
